# 💰 Expense Tracker - MERN Stack

A full-stack web application that helps users track their income and expenses with a simple and clean interface.

## 👨‍💻 Author
**Barath G**  
[GitHub Profile](https://github.com/bharath132)

---

## 🔗 Live Demo
🌐 [Visit the Live App](https://expense-tracker-orpin-six.vercel.app)

---

## 📌 Features

- Add and delete transactions (Income/Expense)
- View total balance, income, and expense summary
- Backend with Express & MongoDB for storing data
- RESTful APIs for data interaction
- **(Planned)** User authentication (JWT)
- **(Planned)** Responsive Design for mobile users

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

**Frontend**  
- React.js  
- CSS

**Backend**  
- Node.js  
- Express.js  
- MongoDB (via Mongoose)

---

